(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-34","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["接头的余料很[[slim|少]]，季禾没有把做好它说成一句[[moral|道德的]]保证。顾衡[[brave|勇敢地]]上高坡，一声[[whistle|哨声]]通知撤开塌土下方；沈砚扶好铲的[[handle|柄]]，铲土这件[[tough|困难的]]事仍只能慢做。沟边的[[crossing|过路处]]必须留给水车，修渠只是[[partial|部分的]]救急，罗清的[[aid|援助]]还不能停。陶溯递旧租契，说拆院无[[valid|有效的]]授权。沈砚把共同签字给他看，同时保留他要求的补修位置，既有错账证据，施工也仍须自己留得住的手续。","大家想要一个[[outcome|结果]]，不是图纸的[[elegant|优美]]。罗清摸过病童[[tender|一触即痛的]]手，问昨日所采植物的[[species|种类]]，免得搬入医馆的新叶不宜接近孩子。她不会因[[royal|皇家]]旧器上有印就更信水质。季禾在临时[[shed|棚屋]]戴好[[glove|手套]]，将铜阀[[rear|后部]]对齐尺寸。私院的[[estate|地产]]主想把新[[brass|黄铜]]接头只装自己那边，请许庭帮说。许庭愿保这个大买家的[[favour|好感]]，看见顾衡记录了两口出口，才明白再偏一边会立即留在纸上。","一张签过的施工图不能[[dictate|规定]]水必须听话。沟壁的[[construction|结构]]已经变形，要作[[radical|根本的]]修正。季禾重提开口的[[application|申请]]，低声[[whisper|说]]第一次量错半寸。顾衡没有喝斥，因为再骂也不能把铜变宽。医馆病者仍少[[appetite|食欲]]，罗清不[[resort|诉诸]]秘方，一例例留观察。旧阀为何失踪的[[mystery|疑问]]已有答案，重铸所需的[[deposit|定金]]却又让沈砚为难。许庭愿先出一半，要收租约加期；沈砚接受明列的利息，拒绝以水票抵押。","季禾是[[skillful|娴熟的]]铸工，却对变形的井口[[housing|外罩]]没有十足把握。有人称陶溯是[[devil|恶魔]]，季禾把铜放进[[vice|虎钳]]，说骂人不是度量。这份[[classic|典型的]]旧阀也不提供[[absolute|绝对的]]正确尺寸，他请屋主[[describe|描述]]过去如何开闸。顾衡阻止年轻人[[grab|抢]]走旧件，[[presently|不久]]还需装回原口。到[[dusk|黄昏]]，家属搬来的旧[[furniture|家具]]搭起干平台，工人终于不用跪在污泥里熔铜。每人都做能查出的事，罗清仍看着那排病床，没被铸火引走。","季禾重做[[mold|铸模]]，用[[bold|醒目的]]线标出大半寸处。城门[[trumpet|喇叭]]催交晚水，料棚的[[boom|隆隆声]]盖过争执。他们的[[conclusion|结论]]是先装公井侧口，沈砚[[rather|宁可]]再付一日租金，也不让未经量好的接头仓促入井。新铜是否[[durable|耐用]]需留下后续检查，不能凭今天好看就终身免验。旧件安在[[rack|架上]]保管，顾衡这名修渠[[leader|负责人]]签了量尺差异，季禾也签。错量者不必被驱逐，却必须把返工和费用说清，免得下一班沿错尺寸继续。","第二次合口终于严密，季禾没欢呼，先让水只过小半闸，检查两端。沈砚原想让人立刻排队，罗清提醒试流不等于能饮，他便改告示，把洗涤与饮用暂分。陶溯拿到私院补修单，也收到返还公用阀和回填款的核查单，两笔互不抵销。夜里库门不能再独锁，钥匙由院主与外户各一把。这个进展使大家能睡上一阵，却还没有结束。水路试流带出一片上游山门封蜡，季禾将它放入样包：孤城供水的窄处，可能还在城墙之外。"],"en":["Material was [[slim|slim]]; Ji offered no [[moral|moral]] guarantee. Gu was [[brave|brave]] on the slope, using a [[whistle|whistle]] to clear unsafe ground. Shen gripped a shovel’s [[handle|handle]]. This [[tough|tough]] work was slow. The cart [[crossing|crossing]] remained open: canal work was only [[partial|partial]] relief, and Luo’s [[aid|aid]] continued. Tao questioned [[valid|valid]] authority. Shen showed shared signatures and recorded legitimate wall repairs; evidence of wrongdoing did not exempt their own construction from accountable procedure.","They needed an [[outcome|outcome]], not an [[elegant|elegant]] drawing. Luo checked a child’s [[tender|tender]] hand and the [[species|species]] of a carried plant. A [[royal|royal]] mark did not certify water. In a [[shed|shed]], Ji put on a [[glove|glove]] and measured the valve’s [[rear|rear]]. The [[estate|estate]] owner wanted new [[brass|brass]] parts only for his outlet. Xu valued that customer’s [[favour|favour]], until Gu’s records of both mouths made preferential installation plainly visible.","Plans could not [[dictate|dictate]] water. Distorted [[construction|construction]] required [[radical|radical]] correction. Ji renewed an [[application|application]] and admitted in a [[whisper|whisper]] a half-inch measuring error. Gu did not shout. Patients lacked [[appetite|appetite]], and Luo would not [[resort|resort]] to secret remedies. The missing valve’s [[mystery|mystery]] was resolved, but another [[deposit|deposit]] was needed. Xu advanced half in exchange for extended hire; Shen accepted specified interest, refusing a pledge of water tickets.","A [[skillful|skillful]] caster, Ji was unsure of the distorted [[housing|housing]]. Someone called Tao a [[devil|devil]]; Ji clamped brass in a [[vice|vice]] and said insults were not measurements. A [[classic|classic]] valve offered no [[absolute|absolute]] dimensions. Owners would [[describe|describe]] past operation. Gu stopped workers trying to [[grab|grab]] parts needed [[presently|presently]]. At [[dusk|dusk]], old [[furniture|furniture]] made a dry work platform. Luo stayed beside beds instead of following casting flames.","Ji remade the [[mold|mold]], marking changes with [[bold|bold]] lines. A gate [[trumpet|trumpet]] requested evening water above the workshop’s [[boom|boom]]. Their [[conclusion|conclusion]] was the public side outlet first. Shen would [[rather|rather]] pay another rental day than fit an unchecked part. [[durable|Durable]] service needed later inspection, not lifetime trust from appearance. Parts stayed on a [[rack|rack]]. Gu, the repair [[leader|leader]], and Ji both signed the measured difference. Mistakes required declared costs and correction, not expulsion or hidden repetition.","The second fit held. Ji tested a small flow and both ends. Luo stopped Shen announcing drinking supply before checks; he separated washing and drinking notices. Tao received wall repairs and separate claims for public valves and funds. They did not cancel one another. Two parties now held store keys. During trial flow a fragment of an upstream sect’s seal emerged. Ji preserved it. Their next constriction might lie beyond the city walls."]});
